OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh University lecturers
OL,4,Abegin five-week strike over cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrincipal Prof Sir Peter Mathieson said
OL,7,Fthe strike would unfairly and
OL,8,Fdeliberately target students' first
OL,9,Fsemester, and the university had to
OL,10,Ftake difficult decisions to secure its
OL,11,Ffuture.
